OL,5,G0215 Eric Clapton: 24 Nights
OL,6,     FHighlights from Eric Clapton's
OL,7,     Frecord-setting run at The Royal
OL,8,     FAlbert Hall in 1990-1991, where he
OL,9,     Fperformed hits spanning his entire
OL,10,     Fcareer over 24 consecutive
OL,11,     Fsold-out nights.
OL,12,G0435 Discovering: Jimi Hendrix
OL,13,     FMusic experts discuss the life and
OL,14,     Fmusic of Jimi Hendrix, who wowed
OL,15,     Faudiences in the 1960s with his
OL,16,     Foutrageous electric guitar playing
OL,17,     Fskills and his experimental sound.
